{"Negative cursor offset values can reach queryset slicing (e.g., queryset[-5:...]), causing Django to reject with negative-indexing assertion and return 500": 0.9307227730751038, "OptimizedCursorPaginator uses math.floor/math.ceil on datetime objects when building cursors for audit logs ordered by datetime, causing 500 errors": 0.9185196757316589, "zpopmin eviction of oldest spans can remove the segment/root span marker while keeping has_root_span_key set, breaking segment reconstruction downstream": 0.9490790367126465, "Redis key type changes from SET to SORTED SET in place, causing WRONGTYPE errors during rolling deploy while old set-typed keys remain alive": 0.9780591726303101, "end_timestamp_precise is now required for retained ingest-spans Kafka messages, causing KeyError for messages from older producers that omit the field": 0.9802377223968506, "Redirect traversal cap reduced from 10000 to 1000 without overflow handling, causing deep redirect chains to stop at intermediate set ids and link spans into wrong partial trees": 0.954963743686676, "Span eviction is hard-coded to 1000 in Lua while SpansBuffer.max_segment_spans is no longer enforced during flush, ignoring configured span limits": 0.9738937020301819}